B.avs=new A.Cb("Cool Route","Picks the shadiest loop for your distance: covered walkways, tree-lined paths and the shadow of tall buildings at the time you tap Generate. The shade share shows on your route. After sunset every route is cool, so it makes no difference at night.",null)
B.avt=new A.Cb("Hill Run","Finds the nearest climb that fits your distance, then repeats it: sprint up, jog down to recover. The repeats bring the run to the distance you chose. The run screen tells you when to sprint and when to ease off, and your phone buzzes at each change.",null)
B.avu=new A.Cb("Heart Run","Your route draws a heart on the map, starting where you are or up to 1 km away. It draws a few, 5 to 8 km, at different spots for you to pick from, so the distance above doesn't apply, and neither do your preferences: the heart may cross bridges and double back. Streets make the heart blocky; it keeps to them close to the outline, shown faintly under the route. A grid of streets draws it best.",null)
